  4.2  With explicit prior written permission from the author, the requirement
       in Section 4.1(a) to include this license may be waived or modified
       (for example, where the author has approved a redistribution under
       different or additional terms). Such permission may be requested by
       contacting the author through https://github.com/THMSCMPG.

