SECTION 5 — MODIFICATIONS AND SHARE-BACK

  5.1  You may modify this work for your own private academic or personal
       research. You are not required to share those modifications unless they
       are published.

  5.2  If you publish a paper, thesis, conference proceedings, or any other
       academic work that incorporates or substantially relies on modifications
       you have made to this repository, you must make those modifications
       available to the author. Specifically:

         (a) Send a copy of the modified source (or a link to it) to the author
             via the GitHub profile at https://github.com/THMSCMPG, no later
             than the date of public availability of the publication.

         (b) Include a description of what was changed and why.

  5.3  The share-back obligation does not require you to publish your
       modifications publicly — sharing them with the author satisfies the
       requirement.

  5.4  The author retains the right to incorporate shared modifications into
       the main project at their discretion.

