SECTION 6 — PROHIBITION ON AI/ML TRAINING USE

  6.1  The source code, data, documentation, schemas, scripts, models,
       configuration files, and any other content in this repository may not
       be used — in whole or in part — as:

         (a) training data for any machine learning or artificial intelligence
             model or system;
         (b) fine-tuning data for any pre-trained model;
         (c) evaluation or benchmark data in the context of model development;
         (d) any other input to a pipeline whose primary purpose is learning
             statistical patterns from this content.

  6.2  This prohibition applies regardless of whether the resulting model is
       commercial, academic, open-source, or private.

  6.3  Automated scraping, crawling, or ingestion of this repository's contents
       for the purposes described in 6.1 is explicitly prohibited.

